      "text": "🚨 FACT-CHECK | @cyberpoe_\n\nCLAIM:\n“Highways in Lupi, Camarines Sur cracked due to DPWH corruption proof of the multi-billion peso scandal.”\n\nVERDICT: 🟥 FALSE\nThe viral photos aren’t from Camarines Sur. They show earthquake damage in New Zealand (2011) and Mindanao (2019).\n\n🔽 Full breakdown in thread ⤵️\nhttps://t.co/SLIYr9tIJT\n\nFull breakdown in thread ⤵️\n#CyberPoe #FactCheck #Philippines #DPWH",
